xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M0.999819 9.58728L5.29346 5.29364L0.999819 1\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div><div class=\"text-color-black\">Company</div><div class=\"nav_dropdown-line\"></div></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><a href=\"/company/why-accord\" class=\"nav_link\">Why Accord</a><a href=\"/company/about\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"nav_link w--current\">About Us</a><a href=\"https://inaccord.com/company/about#careers\" class=\"nav_link\">Careers</a><a href=\"/referral-program\" class=\"nav_link\">Referral Program</a><a href=\"/company/contact-us\" class=\"nav_link\">Contact Us</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"nav_button-wrapper is-mobile\"><a href=\"https://login.inaccord.com/sign-in\" class=\"nav_link-login\">Log In</a><a href=\"/book-demo\" class=\"button is-nav w-button\">Book a Demo</a></div></div></nav><div class=\"nav_button-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://login.inaccord.com/sign-in\" class=\"nav_link-login\">Log In</a><a href=\"/book-demo\" class=\"button is-nav w-button\">Book a Demo</a></div><div class=\"nav_button w-nav-button\"><div class=\"menu-icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"nav_burger one-line\"></div><div class=\"nav_burger center-line\"></div><div class=\"nav_burger last-line\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"page-wrapper\"><section class=\"section_about-wrapper\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"padding-section-about\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><div data-w-id=\"f0a54fce-67e8-14ed-ed67-ab308b8ffcff\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"w-layout-vflex v-flex-center text-align-center\"><div class=\"text-title\">AI-Powered Revenue Excellence</div><div class=\"spacer-2-25\"></div><div class=\"max-width-54\"><h1>We’re Accord</h1></div><div class=\"spacer-2-25\"></div><div class=\"max-width-50\"><p>We help revenue team enforce exceptional standards for how they sell, onboard, and expand with prospects and customers.</p><div class=\"spacer-1-625\"></div></div><div class=\"button-wrapper\"><a href=\"/book-demo\" class=\"button is-dark w-button\">Get Started with a Demo</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"section_home-team\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><div class=\"padding-section-accordians z-index-1\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid_2-col-about\"><div><div class=\"text-title\">The Accordians</div><div class=\"spacer-3\"></div><div class=\"max-width-30\"><h3>Committed to excellence</h3></div><div class=\"spacer-2-25\"></div><p>We are a diverse group of problem solvers who are passionate about helping B2B orgs reach their full revenue potential.</p></div><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/6a7f4430a17d666a437e5c1d_Company%20photo%20website.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, 49vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/6a7f4430a17d666a437e5c1d_Company%20photo%20website-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/6a7f4430a17d666a437e5c1d_Company%20photo%20website-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/6a7f4430a17d666a437e5c1d_Company%20photo%20website.jpg 1026w\" alt=\"\"/></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8e453532cddcba89b8d6a_The%20Accordians%20bg.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"opacity:0\" data-w-id=\"40a75965-f164-832d-cbcc-ed29f2a67633\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-team-bg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section_about-body\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"padding-section-xxlarge\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><h3>Founding Team</h3><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid_about-team\"><div data-w-id=\"a2b8440f-72ae-47f5-fa49-8819134a4b80\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bdb5a99e639d7be48f_Ross%20Rich.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 684px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bdb5a99e639d7be48f_Ross%20Rich-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bdb5a99e639d7be48f_Ross%20Rich.webp 684w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-founder\"/><h6>Ross Rich</h6><div>Co-founder &amp; CEO</div></div><div data-w-id=\"f729a1d5-910e-2558-7ea4-e7282c096000\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd6eb74fbaa0fac5b3_Ryan%20Rich.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 684px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd6eb74fbaa0fac5b3_Ryan%20Rich-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd6eb74fbaa0fac5b3_Ryan%20Rich.webp 684w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-founder\"/><h6>Ryan Rich</h6><div>Co-founder &amp; CCO</div></div><div data-w-id=\"29ff2ee0-fc1b-3506-b7ca-53d46dabe33b\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd4db75ea7285fe624_Wayne%20Pan.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, (max-width: 1439px) 49vw, 684px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd4db75ea7285fe624_Wayne%20Pan-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68d3df3714cf3a122c1640dd/68f8d1bd4db75ea7285fe624_Wayne%20Pan.webp 684w\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-founder\"/><h6>Wayne Pan</h6><div>Co-founder &amp; CTO</div></div></div><p class=\"text-size-xlarge text-weight-light\">The idea for Accord was born from seeing the challenges revenue orgs were facing when trying to operationalize a B2B sales process.<br/><br/>When Accord was founded, there was no system or platform built for rigorous deal execution, even if the ideal customer journey was figured out. Accord is still the only platform that changes the way your team sells—enforcing CFO-proof business cases, multi-threading, mutual action plans and all the things your top reps do naturally.<br/><br/>Accord was co-founded in early 2020 by Ross Rich, Ryan Rich and Wayne Pan. Ross was one of the first salespeople at Stripe back in 2015, while Ryan was an early sales hire at Google Cloud, and Wayne an exec at LinkedIn.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section_about-values\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"padding-section-xlarge\"><div class=\"container-xxlarge\"><h3 class=\"text-align-center\">Our values</h3><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid_about-values\"><div class=\"about-values-box\"><h6>Everyone is a product person</h6><div class=\"value-break-line\"></div><div>We all share the same drive and passion to create</div></div><div class=\"about-values-box\"><h6>10/10 <br/>‍</h6><div class=\"value-break-line\"></div><div>9/10 is not enough. The last 10% delivers 90% of the value</div></div><div class=\"about-values-box\"><h6>Integrity Over Everything</h6><div class=\"value-break-line\"></div><div>What matters is what we do when no one is watching</div></div><div class=\"about-values-box\"><h6>Radical Collaboration</h6><div class=\"value-break-line\"></div><div>From Engineering to CS — we work, win, &amp; grow together</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section_about-body\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"padding-section-9-5\"><div class=\"container-medium\"><h3>In the news</h3><div class=\"collection_list-pa-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"collection_list-pa w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a data-w-id=\"12ca1a2f-56fa-d535-e179-2bedd804d872\" href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2023/01/24/accord-which-offers-a-platform-to-manage-sales-processes-secures-10m/\" class=\"link-block-pa w-inline-block\"><div class=\"link-pa-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"pa-logo-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f8c3846e57b4d7d86cd511/68f8da888d4e5dee1c87c66f_techcrunch-logo-1%202.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-news-logo\"/>